{"seq":2,"slug":"custom-hooks-patterns","title":"自定义 Hook 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/custom-hooks-patterns","wordCount":554,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义-hook-模式\">自定义 Hook 模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自定义 Hook 是一个以 <code>use</code> 开头的普通函数，内部可以调用其他 Hook，是 React 复用有状态逻辑的主要方式。相比 HOC 和 Render Props，它不引入额外的组件层级，类型推断更友好、组合更灵活。本章讲解如何把组件中重复的状态、副作用与事件监听逻辑抽取为自定义 Hook，如何组合出更高层次的抽象，如何设计返回值，以及如何用 <code>renderHook</code> 做单元测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要自定义-hook\">为什么需要自定义 Hook</h2><p>自定义 Hook 是 React 中<strong>复用有状态逻辑</strong>的主要方式。它是一个以 <code>use</code> 开头的普通函数，内部可以调用其他 Hook。与 HOC 和 Render Props 相比，自定义 Hook 不引入额外组件层级，类型推断更友好，组合更灵活。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 传统方案&#10;        A[HOC] --&gt; B[包裹组件层级增加]&#10;        C[Render Props] --&gt; D[嵌套回调地狱]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 自定义 Hook&#10;        E[useXxx] --&gt; F[无额外层级]&#10;        E --&gt; G[类型安全]&#10;        E --&gt; H[自由组合]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 传统方案\n        A[HOC] --&gt; B[包裹组件层级增加]\n        C[Render Props] --&gt; D[嵌套回调地狱]\n    end\n    subgraph 自定义 Hook\n        E[useXxx] --&gt; F[无额外层级]\n        E --&gt; G[类型安全]\n        E --&gt; H[自由组合]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"逻辑抽取\">逻辑抽取</h2><p>自定义 Hook 的核心价值是将组件中可复用的逻辑提取为独立函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"提取前\">提取前</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  const [user, setUser] = useState&lt;User | null&gt;(null);&#10;  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);&#10;  const [error, setError] = useState&lt;Error | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    let cancelled = false;&#10;    setLoading(true);&#10;&#10;    fetchUser(userId)&#10;      .then((data) =&gt; {&#10;        if (!cancelled) {&#10;          setUser(data);&#10;          setError(null);&#10;        }&#10;      })&#10;      .catch((err) =&gt; {&#10;        if (!cancelled) setError(err);&#10;      })&#10;      .finally(() =&gt; {&#10;        if (!cancelled) setLoading(false);&#10;      });&#10;&#10;    return () =&gt; {&#10;      cancelled = true;&#10;    };&#10;  }, [userId]);&#10;&#10;  if (loading) return &lt;Spinner /&gt;;&#10;  if (error) return &lt;ErrorMessage error={error} /&gt;;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{user?.name}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [user, setUser] = useState&#x3C;User | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [error, setError] = useState&#x3C;Error | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cancelled = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setLoading(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchUser(userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .then((data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!cancelled) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          setUser(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          setError(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .catch((err) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!cancelled) setError(err);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .finally(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!cancelled) setLoading(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cancelled = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [userId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (loading) return &#x3C;Spinner />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (error) return &#x3C;ErrorMessage error={error} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{user?.name}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提取后\">提取后</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function useAsync&lt;T&gt;(asyncFn: () =&gt; Promise&lt;T&gt;, deps: readonly unknown[]) {&#10;  const [state, setState] = useState&lt;{&#10;    data: T | null;&#10;    loading: boolean;&#10;    error: Error | null;&#10;  }&gt;({ data: null, loading: true, error: null });&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    let cancelled = false;&#10;    setState((prev) =&gt; ({ ...prev, loading: true }));&#10;&#10;    asyncFn()&#10;      .then((data) =&gt; {&#10;        if (!cancelled) setState({ data, loading: false, error: null });&#10;      })&#10;      .catch((error) =&gt; {&#10;        if (!cancelled) setState({ data: null, loading: false, error });&#10;      });&#10;&#10;    return () =&gt; {&#10;      cancelled = true;&#10;    };&#10;  }, deps);&#10;&#10;  return state;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  const { data: user, loading, error } = useAsync(() =&gt; fetchUser(userId), [userId]);&#10;&#10;  if (loading) return &lt;Spinner /&gt;;&#10;  if (error) return &lt;ErrorMessage error={error} /&gt;;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{user?.name}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function useAsync&#x3C;T>(asyncFn: () => Promise&#x3C;T>, deps: readonly unknown[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [state, setState] = useState&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: T | null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loading: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error: Error | null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }>({ data: null, loading: true, error: null });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cancelled = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setState((prev) => ({ ...prev, loading: true }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    asyncFn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .then((data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!cancelled) setState({ data, loading: false, error: null });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .catch((error) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!cancelled) setState({ data: null, loading: false, error });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cancelled = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, deps);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { data: user, loading, error } = useAsync(() => fetchUser(userId), [userId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (loading) return &#x3C;Spinner />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (error) return &#x3C;ErrorMessage error={error} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{user?.name}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合模式\">组合模式</h2><p>自定义 Hook 可以调用其他自定义 Hook，形成组合链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function useDebounce&lt;T&gt;(value: T, delay: number): T {&#10;  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState(value);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; setDebouncedValue(value), delay);&#10;    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(timer);&#10;  }, [value, delay]);&#10;&#10;  return debouncedValue;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function useSearch(query: string) {&#10;  const debouncedQuery = useDebounce(query, 300);&#10;&#10;  const { data, loading, error } = useAsync(&#10;    () =&gt; (debouncedQuery ? searchApi(debouncedQuery) : Promise.resolve([])),&#10;    [debouncedQuery],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return { results: data ?? [], loading, error };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function useDebounce&#x3C;T>(value: T, delay: number): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const timer = setTimeout(() => setDebouncedValue(value), delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => clearTimeout(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [value, delay]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return debouncedValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function useSearch(query: string) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const debouncedQuery = useDebounce(query, 300);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { data, loading, error } = useAsync(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => (debouncedQuery ? searchApi(debouncedQuery) : Promise.resolve([])),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [debouncedQuery],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return { results: data ?? [], loading, error };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[useSearch] --&gt; B[useDebounce]&#10;    A --&gt; C[useAsync]&#10;    B --&gt; D[useState]&#10;    B --&gt; E[useEffect]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; E\">flowchart LR\n    A[useSearch] --&gt; B[useDebounce]\n    A --&gt; C[useAsync]\n    B --&gt; D[useState]\n    B --&gt; E[useEffect]\n    C --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; E</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"返回值模式\">返回值模式</h2><p>自定义 Hook 的返回值设计直接影响使用体验。常见的返回模式有三种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>元组</td>\n<td><code>[value, setValue]</code></td>\n<td>两个值，类似 <code>useState</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象</td>\n<td><code>{ data, loading, error }</code></td>\n<td>多个值，需要按名解构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单值</td>\n<td><code>debouncedValue</code></td>\n<td>只返回一个计算值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function useToggle(initial = false): [boolean, () =&gt; void] {&#10;  const [value, setValue] = useState(initial);&#10;  const toggle = useCallback(() =&gt; setValue((v) =&gt; !v), []);&#10;  return [value, toggle];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function useLocalStorage&lt;T&gt;(key: string, initialValue: T) {&#10;  const [storedValue, setStoredValue] = useState&lt;T&gt;(() =&gt; {&#10;    try {&#10;      const item = window.localStorage.getItem(key);&#10;      return item ? (JSON.parse(item) as T) : initialValue;&#10;    } catch {&#10;      return initialValue;&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const setValue = useCallback(&#10;    (value: T | ((prev: T) =&gt; T)) =&gt; {&#10;      setStoredValue((prev) =&gt; {&#10;        const valueToStore = value instanceof Function ? value(prev) : value;&#10;        window.localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(valueToStore));&#10;        return valueToStore;&#10;      });&#10;    },&#10;    [key],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return { storedValue, setValue } as const;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function useToggle(initial = false): [boolean, () => void] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [value, setValue] = useState(initial);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const toggle = useCallback(() => setValue((v) => !v), []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return [value, toggle];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function useLocalStorage&#x3C;T>(key: string, initialValue: T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [storedValue, setStoredValue] = useState&#x3C;T>(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const item = window.localStorage.getItem(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return item ? (JSON.parse(item) as T) : initialValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return initialValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const setValue = useCallback(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (value: T | ((prev: T) => T)) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setStoredValue((prev) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const valueToStore = value instanceof Function ? value(prev) : value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        window.localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(valueToStore));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return valueToStore;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [key],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return { storedValue, setValue } as const;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 当返回值只有 2 个时优先使用元组，允许调用方自由命名。当返回值超过 2 个时使用对象，提高可读性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试自定义-hook\">测试自定义 Hook</h2><p>自定义 Hook 不能直接调用，必须在 React 组件或 <code>renderHook</code> 中使用。<code>@testing-library/react</code> 提供了 <code>renderHook</code> 工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { renderHook, act } from &#39;@testing-library/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;useToggle&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;should toggle value&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const { result } = renderHook(() =&gt; useToggle(false));&#10;&#10;    expect(result.current[0]).toBe(false);&#10;&#10;    act(() =&gt; {&#10;      result.current[1]();&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    expect(result.current[0]).toBe(true);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;should accept initial value&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const { result } = renderHook(() =&gt; useToggle(true));&#10;    expect(result.current[0]).toBe(true);&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;useDebounce&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  beforeEach(() =&gt; {&#10;    jest.useFakeTimers();&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  afterEach(() =&gt; {&#10;    jest.useRealTimers();&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;should debounce value changes&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const { result, rerender } = renderHook(({ value, delay }) =&gt; useDebounce(value, delay), {&#10;      initialProps: { value: &#39;hello&#39;, delay: 300 },&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    expect(result.current).toBe(&#39;hello&#39;);&#10;&#10;    rerender({ value: &#39;world&#39;, delay: 300 });&#10;    expect(result.current).toBe(&#39;hello&#39;);&#10;&#10;    act(() =&gt; {&#10;      jest.advanceTimersByTime(300);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    expect(result.current).toBe(&#39;world&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { renderHook, act } from '@testing-library/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe('useToggle', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  it('should toggle value', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const { result } = renderHook(() => useToggle(false));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result.current[0]).toBe(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    act(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      result.current[1]();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result.current[0]).toBe(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  it('should accept initial value', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const { result } = renderHook(() => useToggle(true));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result.current[0]).toBe(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe('useDebounce', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  beforeEach(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jest.useFakeTimers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  afterEach(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jest.useRealTimers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  it('should debounce value changes', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const { result, rerender } = renderHook(({ value, delay }) => useDebounce(value, delay), {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      initialProps: { value: 'hello', delay: 300 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result.current).toBe('hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rerender({ value: 'world', delay: 300 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result.current).toBe('hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    act(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      jest.advanceTimersByTime(300);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result.current).toBe('world');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[编写自定义 Hook] --&gt; B[使用 renderHook 渲染]&#10;    B --&gt; C[通过 result.current 读取返回值]&#10;    C --&gt; D[使用 act 触发状态更新]&#10;    D --&gt; E[断言新的返回值]&#10;    E --&gt; F[使用 rerender 模拟 props 变化]\">flowchart TD\n    A[编写自定义 Hook] --&gt; B[使用 renderHook 渲染]\n    B --&gt; C[通过 result.current 读取返回值]\n    C --&gt; D[使用 act 触发状态更新]\n    D --&gt; E[断言新的返回值]\n    E --&gt; F[使用 rerender 模拟 props 变化]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自定义 Hook 是以 <code>use</code> 开头的函数，可以调用其他 Hook，用于复用有状态逻辑</li>\n<li>将组件中重复的状态管理、副作用、事件监听逻辑抽取为自定义 Hook 可以显著提高复用性</li>\n<li>自定义 Hook 可以<strong>组合</strong>其他自定义 Hook，构建高层次的逻辑抽象</li>\n<li>返回值设计遵循：2 个值用元组，多个值用对象，单个值直接返回</li>\n<li>使用 <code>renderHook</code> 和 <code>act</code> 进行单元测试，确保 Hook 行为正确</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义 Hook 模式","id":"自定义-hook-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要自定义 Hook","id":"为什么需要自定义-hook"},{"level":2,"text":"逻辑抽取","id":"逻辑抽取"},{"level":3,"text":"提取前","id":"提取前"},{"level":3,"text":"提取后","id":"提取后"},{"level":2,"text":"组合模式","id":"组合模式"},{"level":2,"text":"返回值模式","id":"返回值模式"},{"level":2,"text":"测试自定义 Hook","id":"测试自定义-hook"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hooks 内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/hooks-internals"},"next":{"title":"useEffect 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/use-effect-deep-dive"}}